{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00808",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.42,
      "end_seconds": 14.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.48,
      "text": "So, my left calf. It cramps up when I walk, just a couple of blocks, and I have to stop. Two blocks, no, maybe three."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.77,
      "end_seconds": 19.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Like a charley horse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.67,
      "end_seconds": 31.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.66,
      "text": "Kind of, but it's more of a squeeze, and it goes away if I stand still for a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.95,
      "end_seconds": 35.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "When did this start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.01,
      "end_seconds": 46.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "Oh. Last fall. Or was it the winter before? I really couldn't tell you, it kind of crept up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.68,
      "end_seconds": 52.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Anything else in the leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.33,
      "end_seconds": 68.46,
      "duration_seconds": 15.13,
      "text": "My left foot gets cold. Colder than the right. And it aches at night, in the arch, and I hang it over the side of the bed and that helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.71,
      "end_seconds": 73.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Do your legs feel tired?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.6,
      "end_seconds": 76.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Heavy, yes, by evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.65,
      "end_seconds": 82.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Any chest pain when you walk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.84,
      "end_seconds": 86.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.3,
      "end_seconds": 89.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Short of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.1,
      "end_seconds": 93.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.88,
      "end_seconds": 97.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Swelling in the legs?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.58,
      "end_seconds": 100.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "No swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.75,
      "end_seconds": 106.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Any back pain, shooting down the leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.1,
      "end_seconds": 111.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "No, it's just the calf."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.1,
      "end_seconds": 114.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.44,
      "end_seconds": 119.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "No numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.11,
      "end_seconds": 123.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "What do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.24,
      "end_seconds": 135.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "Atorvastatin, maybe 40 mg, at night. And lisinopril, 10 mg, every day. Well, most days. I forget it sometimes when I'm travelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.99,
      "end_seconds": 140.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "So most days. Allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.38,
      "end_seconds": 149.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "Contrast dye, from a scan. I'm allergic, they told me, but I can't remember what happened."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.18,
      "end_seconds": 151.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "History?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.97,
      "end_seconds": 157.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "High cholesterol, high blood pressure, and pre-diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.99,
      "end_seconds": 160.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Surgery?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.34,
      "end_seconds": 165.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Knee scope, in 2012."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.43,
      "end_seconds": 169.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.75,
      "end_seconds": 179.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "My father lost a leg to circulation trouble. My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.66,
      "end_seconds": 183.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.19,
      "end_seconds": 192.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "A pack a day for thirty years. I'm trying to quit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.95,
      "end_seconds": 194.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Drink?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.22,
      "end_seconds": 199.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "A couple of beers on weekends."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.25,
      "end_seconds": 203.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Do you exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.48,
      "end_seconds": 212.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "I walk the dog, but I can't go far. That's how it got noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.72,
      "end_seconds": 241.15,
      "duration_seconds": 10.43,
      "text": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 148 over 88, pulse 82, temperature 36.8, oxygen 97 percent, breathing 16, and weight 96 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.53,
      "end_seconds": 245.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "That's high, huh? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.78,
      "end_seconds": 267.68,
      "duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "text": "A bit. Now let me feel for the pulses in your feet. Think of the artery as a garden hose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.01,
      "end_seconds": 271.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "A hose? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.16,
      "end_seconds": 292.4,
      "duration_seconds": 19.24,
      "text": "If the hose is kinked or clogged, the water doesn't reach the end. I can feel a pulse in your right foot, but I can't feel a pulse at the left foot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.2,
      "end_seconds": 296.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Oh. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.77,
      "end_seconds": 305.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "And the left foot is cooler than the right, and a bit shiny."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.8,
      "end_seconds": 309.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "That's what I noticed. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.39,
      "end_seconds": 316.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Any trouble with your breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.36,
      "end_seconds": 320.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.35,
      "end_seconds": 328.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "What I think is happening is narrowing of the arteries in the leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.07,
      "end_seconds": 334.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is that the hose? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.77,
      "end_seconds": 353.5,
      "duration_seconds": 17.73,
      "text": "Exactly. I'd like to arrange a test comparing the blood pressure in your ankle and your arm, an ultrasound of the leg arteries, and blood tests for cholesterol and sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.27,
      "end_seconds": 359.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "When can that happen? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.92,
      "end_seconds": 370.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Reception will book them. And I'd like to start clopidogrel, 75 mg, once a day, to thin the blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.36,
      "end_seconds": 373.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.55,
      "end_seconds": 384.82,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "The biggest thing you can do is stop smoking. It's like pouring sludge in the hose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.39,
      "end_seconds": 390.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I know. I will. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.59,
      "end_seconds": 396.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.7,
      "end_seconds": 401.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Two weeks. Thanks, doc. ~"
    }
  ]
}
